    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d168">

                <pb facs="0230" n="114" xml:id="pg114"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/803.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the American Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-03-16T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 16, 1912—6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In regard to your telegram March 16, promptly take steps necessary to safeguard
                    all legitimate American interests, consulting colleagues where jointly
                    concerned. The Russian Government has signified readiness in principle to
                    participate in present advances and to designate Russo-Asiatic Bank as agent.
                    Can not competing Russian interests be satisfied on basis of assured
                    participation in pending loans?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Huntington Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
